 "lead_html": "<p>Drawbridge art, first pass (owner, 2026-10-20: <i>\u201ccommission the art for the bridges so it will be ready for you by the time you need it.\u201d</i>). Timber and steel, matched to the suspension bridge beside each row. The lowered leaf reuses the suspension deck, so it is not here. Pick or reject per row; nothing is installed until you rule. \u26a0 Two east views came out three-quarter instead of side/edge-on: timber winch and timber closed gate (flagged on their rows). Rows with no picture are renders still in the queue (the image service throttled us with 429s).</p>"
